This is the commit in which the old signed envelope stopped existing. Its
account, including the assertion that inverted from assert_ne! to assert_eq!
and the two behaviours deliberately tightened, is in the following commit,
"M2 complete: the flows switch, and the envelope is deleted".

Fourth sweep in this migration. See also the notes on 1468e1b1, f5951215, and
01d35152; 311b61a8 named its own sweep correctly. No history surgery was done
to un-bundle any of them, deliberately: sweeping is the house rule and beats
work sitting dirty. The only defect is a message that did not say what it
carried, which is what these notes repair.
